infinite-patch 1
# Solo Piano Acoustic Hammer Felt Synth
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.5
  i steps 16
  i note0 60
  i note1 60
  i note2 67
  i note3 64
